    "$t": "肉羹我上興（hìng） "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張寶明</b></span></p><div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqimdxmBZ3EypPGm3VKx6DBmhSToLbFSTjBJq9SlLIDf1SCMKwEf6lFb6teVopdJfpZnGsi_pLbi1wJvrkaqwnmBqPR7L3KMg38a6qDC3VrrUBATISEyGZgQ01DD7DqdQkIsEJt39eq1QnPJ-ARNM6-qkidci_VH6ftZyGriNaKqL9HS3tg3foe2bJfdLz/s1620/%E8%82%89%E6%A2%9D%E7%B2%89%E6%B8%85%E6%B9%AF%E5%8D%B5%E8%8A%B1%E8%82%89%E7%BE%B9.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"911\" data-original-width=\"1620\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjqimdxmBZ3EypPGm3VKx6DBmhSToLbFSTjBJq9SlLIDf1SCMKwEf6lFb6teVopdJfpZnGsi_pLbi1wJvrkaqwnmBqPR7L3KMg38a6qDC3VrrUBATISEyGZgQ01DD7DqdQkIsEJt39eq1QnPJ-ARNM6-qkidci_VH6ftZyGriNaKqL9HS3tg3foe2bJfdLz/w640-h360/%E8%82%89%E6%A2%9D%E7%B2%89%E6%B8%85%E6%B9%AF%E5%8D%B5%E8%8A%B1%E8%82%89%E7%BE%B9.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKm0CsOoe6L_w9Wrr8nv5APRxwdW1vwNCPd4z3DrfW0REvyB7REcAkhyphenhyphen_2piWtpP8koUpi5rdQQ4wXyzfkE3qWADX4a2XLqFxVfbd-o9s42O7Ey1Ys9fm5SIhWGM6ZBjTN_HjctqnWupQKotDAuObYY2TyHbC-6JYS7-Wgj42D4ukc0-6J5SLp7QOrRLVG/s1620/%E8%82%89%E6%A2%9D%E9%AD%9A%E6%BC%BF%E7%89%BD%E7%BE%B9%E8%82%89%E7%BE%B9.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"911\" data-original-width=\"1620\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKm0CsOoe6L_w9Wrr8nv5APRxwdW1vwNCPd4z3DrfW0REvyB7REcAkhyphenhyphen_2piWtpP8koUpi5rdQQ4wXyzfkE3qWADX4a2XLqFxVfbd-o9s42O7Ey1Ys9fm5SIhWGM6ZBjTN_HjctqnWupQKotDAuObYY2TyHbC-6JYS7-Wgj42D4ukc0-6J5SLp7QOrRLVG/w640-h360/%E8%82%89%E6%A2%9D%E9%AD%9A%E6%BC%BF%E7%89%BD%E7%BE%B9%E8%82%89%E7%BE%B9.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蹛口面leh揣食--ê，便若看著肉羹就有莫名奇妙ê暢，就án-ne起giàn kah bē顧--得，無去食--一-碗-仔kài成ē起pìnn面，我kám真正tio̍h「肉羹giàn」--ah？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人講「久病tsiânn良醫」，我是「食濟無藥醫suah變專家」。Kan-na我蹛ê tsit箍圍仔，肉羹ê做法kah煮法，排列組合就有五種肉羹湯，啊若koh加我家己ê手路煮--ê就六齣--ah！踮台灣佗一个所在有tsiah多元--ê？就我所知--ê應該是無。阮tsia thìng好號做「肉羹聯合國」，決定無人敢hìnn-hainn。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">肉羹本身ê肉條仔，有分全tsiann--ê kah白tsiann--ê兩種，全tsiann ê肉條有人kā號做赤肉羹。做法有kā肉條仔kō漿--ê、kō番薯粉膏--ê、kō ta番薯粉--ê kah肉拍做漿--ê四種。肉條仔beh kō漿、kō粉進前lóng ē先tshiau獨家祕方ê tsô料，有ê芳氣真重，有ê鼻bē出有lām芳料。肉有分做食--起-來軟lio̍h軟lio̍h kah保留肉本底口感--ê兩種，啊he食著軟lio̍h ê肉，是lām木瓜粉iah是摻番薯粉jio̍k--出-來--ê？我喙iáu無hiah利。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">肉羹ê漿應該是魚漿摻肉漿，beh按怎thang食著ē phànn-phànn兼脆脆，當然是頭家in ê know-how，tsit款手路我真生份，tsîng到tann，iáu m̄ bat bak過魚漿iah是肉漿。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮tsia肉羹ê湯有不可思議ê做法，hōo人料想bē到，有夠精彩。有一間店仔ê湯竟然是無粒ê清湯，真正是生目睭發目眉頭擺食--著。其他店仔ê湯若是煮清--ê，khiàn蔥仔頭芳是hōo湯出tioh ê關鍵，拍卵花落--去，lām芫荽iah是芹菜珠kap味，無甜ueh ê湯頭確實ē呵咾--得。湯khah phoo-lú-phián --ê是用太白粉iah是番薯粉牽羹ê煮法。主要是柴箍魚做底ê母湯，調味ê手路，北部--ê是一般鹹siam ê滋味，摻ê粒是卵花。南部--ê是甜甜ê口味，lām ê粒是筍絲、卵花，khah好--ê ē lām香菇絲。用芫荽kap味占大面，啊若摻九層塔kah獨家sa-te--ê是我食--過上特別--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若我leh煮ê肉羹，是下港阮兜傳--落-來ê手路。用全tsiann ê肉條sīnn五香、糖、豆油、味素kah蒜頭，jio̍k-jio̍k--leh囥冰箱一晡久等入味。蒜頭khiàn芳，囥山東白仔絲落去hip kah熟，透湯，lām鹹tsiánn、酸醋kah湯，ài有夠酸、有夠甜。等山東白仔絲kûn爛，湯大滾ê時，kā番薯粉kō tsiâu-tsn̂g ê肉條一條一條囥入去湯--裡，kûn--一-下隨用番薯粉水牽羹，lā-tsiâu就ē-sái享受我上愛ê肉羹--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī阮tsit箍lē仔leh賣ê肉羹湯，我上興--ê是tsit味——肉條kō魚漿，牽羹摻九層塔kah獨家sa-te--ê。Koh來，是肉條kō番薯粉膏，一般鹹siam ê清湯，khiàn蔥仔頭，有卵花，lām芫荽--ê。我認為上歹食--ê是肉拍做漿--ê，無粒ê清湯hit款--ê上怪奇。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">各位，lín bat食--過ê肉羹，是佗一種？我講有tio̍h--無？啊lín上愛食佗一款？Kám有kah我興siāng款？&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFmLJiINu6uZUtU79pXcnd4wsSKRkKjw_6XDz3JmuaIPNp-H_e3osSsCeNKI8Nt5b8ubN6OMFyGkxdhLN0HOnn4uA5S-xq9oL7TNZPipjTL6wniXZfBpkqhyphenhyphenXajAuOQWJ-BiVRxr2bDUoKrf-jT8LlrQo3GtQC14nHmNLOlZ7BeLjh7lgIB0iN1livJFdm/s911/%E8%82%89%E6%A2%9D%E7%B2%89%E7%89%BD%E7%BE%B9%E9%A6%99%E8%8F%87%E8%82%89%E7%BE%B9.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"911\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFmLJiINu6uZUtU79pXcnd4wsSKRkKjw_6XDz3JmuaIPNp-H_e3osSsCeNKI8Nt5b8ubN6OMFyGkxdhLN0HOnn4uA5S-xq9oL7TNZPipjTL6wniXZfBpkqhyphenhyphenXajAuOQWJ-BiVRxr2bDUoKrf-jT8LlrQo3GtQC14nHmNLOlZ7BeLjh7lgIB0iN1livJFdm/w360-h640/%E8%82%89%E6%A2%9D%E7%B2%89%E7%89%BD%E7%BE%B9%E9%A6%99%E8%8F%87%E8%82%89%E7%BE%B9.jpg\" width=\"360\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEieAqLJh7rZoY69Ebj07mQwCBA8QqBIG1F5E-LI-I-AbYGJHjlWObKDm